<title>USA: American Paging Inc Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>American Paging Inc Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.60     loss	 $0.27</p>
<p> Net	loss	   12,129     loss	 5,344</p>
<p> Revs			22,310		   23,708</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,080		   20,041</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 operating expenses $30.8 million vs $27.6 million.</p>
<p>Q1 1997, 1996 revenues reflect service operation revenues. Decline due to 4.3 percent decrease in customer units in service.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 equipment sales $2.3 million vs $2.6 million a year ago.</p>
<p>((-- Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
